to talk about things that-

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.442 align:start size:84% position:16%
I don't want the
country to break up.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:43.410
I think it's an awful thing.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.011
It's my home, it's your home.

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:47.981
I don't wanna have to show
a passport when I go to LAX.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.884
